Input: {"question": "What is \"The 1975\"?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d00", "start": 0, "end": 63, "text": "Mike Crossey, known for his work with Arctic Monkeys and Foals."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d00", "start": 64, "end": 193, "text": "The 1975 were selling out shows even before the debut of their full length as Healy recalls in an interview with \"The AU Review\"."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d00", "start": 194, "end": 269, "text": "The lead single is a re-worked \"Sex\", which was released on 26 August 2013."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d00", "start": 270, "end": 387, "text": "The song premiered on Zane Lowe's BBC Radio 1 show on 8 July 2013, and a music video premiered on YouTube on 26 July."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d00", "start": 388, "end": 444, "text": "\"The 1975\" debuted at number one on the UK Albums Chart."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d00", "start": 445, "end": 535, "text": "The 1975 toured in the UK in September 2013, among others performing in Kingston upon Hull"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d01", "start": 0, "end": 54, "text": "and they 've been making music together since age 13 ."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d01", "start": 55, "end": 177, "text": "Prior to becoming the band 's lead singer and rhythm guitarist with the occasional piano , Healy originally played drums ."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d01", "start": 178, "end": 447, "text": "The musician told GQ about The 1975 's beginnings , explaining that he was approached by Adam Hann 's girlfriend at the time , who was recruiting on Hann 's behalf : `` 'My boyfriend wants to start a band and knows that you play drums , ' '' Healy recalled her saying ."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d01", "start": 448, "end": 496, "text": "`` We all met up , and I was the drummer , and I"}, "D3S1": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d02", "start": 0, "end": 92, "text": "On Notes on a Conditional Form , the opening song deviates from the standard set of lyrics ."}, "D3S2": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d02", "start": 93, "end": 249, "text": "[ 11 ] Lasting 4 minutes and 57 seconds , `` The 1975 '' is a protest song and a work of ambient music , where Thunberg delivers a spoken word performance ."}, "D3S3": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d02", "start": 250, "end": 487, "text": "[ 9 ] [ 14 ] [ 15 ] [ 16 ] The lyrics call for civil disobedience to bring about reduction of greenhouse gas emissions in response to climate change , based on the January 2019 speech `` Our House Is on Fire `` , which Thunberg delivered"}, "D4S1": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d03", "start": 0, "end": 87, "text": "second leg of The 2nd Law World Tour at the Emirates Stadium in London on 26 May 2013 ."}, "D4S2": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d03", "start": 88, "end": 236, "text": "[ 33 ] They also toured with the Neighbourhood in the United States in June 2013 , [ 34 ] and supported the Rolling Stones in Hyde Park on 13 July ."}, "D4S3": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d03", "start": 237, "end": 343, "text": "[ 35 ] In August , the band performed on the Festival Republic Stage at 2013 Reading and Leeds Festivals ."}, "D4S4": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d03", "start": 344, "end": 485, "text": "[ 36 ] In a feature article , Elliot Mitchell of When the Gramophone Rings wrote that releasing a string of EPs before the debut album was ``"}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "a band", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d00:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C1", "answer": "a protest song and a work of ambient music", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d02:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d00", "card_id": "ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d00:c0", "entity": "The 1975", "scope": "general", "claim": "The 1975 is a band that debuted at number one on the UK Albums Chart.", "answer": "a band", "quote": "\"The 1975\" debuted at number one on the UK Albums Chart.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d02", "card_id": "ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3:d02:c0", "entity": "The 1975", "scope": "song", "claim": "\"The 1975\" is a protest song and a work of ambient music.", "answer": "a protest song and a work of ambient music", "quote": "[ 11 ] Lasting 4 minutes and 57 seconds , `` The 1975 '' is a protest song and a work of ambient music , where Thunberg delivers a spoken word performance .", "original_document_number": 3}], "initial_answers": ["a band", "a protest song and a work of ambient music"]}
